  "id": "haptic-picture",
  "term": "haptic picture",
  "definition": "A haptic picture is a picture meant to be examined through touch rather than sight, typically as a raised-line drawing. In this research area, the term often refers to tactile images whose recognition depends on age, experience, memory, and the exploratory hand movements a person uses.",
